{"_meta":{"lovie/risk":"write","openai/toolInvocation/invoked":"Done","openai/toolInvocation/invoking":"Working\u2026","openai/visibility":"public","securitySchemes":[{"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false},"description":"UpsertBeneficialOwner adds or updates one beneficial owner. Send only the fields you mean to change and do not echo the read-only ones: ssn_last4, tax_identifier_kind, identity_document_source and identity_document.number_last4 are refused with INVALID_ARGUMENT when set, and nothing is written; tax_identifier_filed_at is ignored here (send it back as replace_tax_identifier_filed_at). Digits are recorded only after the whole number reached the secret store, so accepting them here would report a saved number that nothing holds. An agent is refused (PERMISSION_DENIED) any write deleting a filed number or ID photo: replace_tax_identifier, a new email, or a document-kind switch. On a submitted application an agent is refused every write to an owner (PERMISSION_DENIED), since each goes to the bank; for the applicant, a write the bank did not reopen is FAILED_PRECONDITION. ABORTED means another change to this owner was in progress: nothing was written, so retry. Changing an existing owner's email needs shown_email set to the email GetBankingApplication returned for this owner; otherwise, or once our banking partner holds the owner as a person, it is FAILED_PRECONDITION and nothing is written.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"applicationId":{"description":"UUID value wrapper.","properties":{"value":{"format":"uuid","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"owner":{"properties":{"address":{"properties":{"city":{"maxLength":100,"type":"string"},"countryCode":{"maxLength":2,"pattern":"^([A-Z]{2})?$","type":"string"},"line1":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"line2":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"postalCode":{"maxLength":20,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9 -]*$","type":"string"},"state":{"maxLength":100,"type":"string"}},"type":"obj